What a waste of reverse-geno!
Why on earth would you want to reverse-geno paper-golems?
Aren't you drowning in other useless scrolls that you can blank?
I have very few scrolls that are worth keeping...
Blank useless junk like light, confuse monster, stinking cloud, magic 
mapping, gold detection, scare monster, earth etc etc.
The only REALLY important scrolls are ID, charging, enchant Armour, 
enchant weapon,cursed destroy armour (for armour-proofing), cursed 
create monster and genocide (optional).
If you don't know how to keep blanking scrolls (run out of fountains), 
there are several great ways of doing it...

1: (a)pply a pick-axe to a fountain to create pools of water all over 
the show.
2: drop everything that can rust
3: drop everything that you don't want exposed to water (valuable 
scrolls/potions)
4: jump in for a refreshing swim! (its actually quite safe so long as 
no-one observes you skinny-dipping ;) )
5: it may take several plunges before everything is thoroughly 
wet/blank/diluted.

It also serves as a great way to check your amulets for magical 
breathing (my favorite amulet), check them all in succession.
If you get magical breathing (or you don't breathe air) you can dive in 
once and #dip everything until they are blank/diluted thoroughly.

Or if you are lucky enough to find and ID boots of water walking, you 
can walk over water and #dip everything, but thats rare in the early game...

